WEBVTT

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.643
Thank God this didn't get
destroyed with the ship!

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:18.560
Yeah!

00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:21.063
That was our bounty to begin with.

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:24.775
We're not letting them run off
with 300 barrels of our dragon oil.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.861
We'll kill it ourselves.

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:36.286
Did we do it?

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:58.183
No way!

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:02.813
Shit!

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.483
What are they doing
making things worse for everyone?

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.027
<i>Engine room, why aren't we taking off?!</i>

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.989
We're doing everything we can!

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:15.659
This is bad!

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:40.183
How was that not enough to kill it?!

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.729
It should be poisoned, too!

00:01:44.021 --> 00:01:45.314
I can't believe it!

00:01:59.077 --> 00:02:00.078
Wait, that direction!

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:04.207
We lost it.

00:02:19.348 --> 00:02:21.266
Those idiots!

00:02:22.225 --> 00:02:24.853
Launch the operation! Don't lag behind!

00:02:24.936 --> 00:02:26.521
Damn it.

00:02:26.897 --> 00:02:28.106
Come on, let's go!

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:29.191
Yeah!

00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:35.238
<i>I'm sure it was</i>

00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:37.115
<i>carelessness.</i>

00:02:37.949 --> 00:02:39.576
<i>Even when we still generally</i>

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.787
<i>don't know dragon biology.</i>

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:44.956
<i>This tragedy</i>

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.460
<i>was brought about by us drakers.</i>

00:04:24.765 --> 00:04:26.516
What a disaster...

00:04:26.641 --> 00:04:29.686
Bridge!
I can't get a clear shot from here!

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:33.148
Can you get me higher
to a better vantage point?

00:04:34.691 --> 00:04:36.276
That ruins the entire plan!

00:04:36.693 --> 00:04:40.322
We're right in the middle of the city.
You think you'll find a spot like that?

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.411
This is awful.

00:04:46.787 --> 00:04:48.455
It's unrecognizable.

00:04:48.914 --> 00:04:51.833
It seems like the townspeople
managed to evacuate.

00:04:53.168 --> 00:04:55.295
Giraud! What were you doing?

00:05:06.681 --> 00:05:09.226
Mika, it can't fly anymore.

00:05:11.019 --> 00:05:11.853
Let's kill it here.

00:05:14.815 --> 00:05:16.942
Isn't that an oil refinery over there?

00:05:17.025 --> 00:05:18.276
You're kidding me!

00:05:18.777 --> 00:05:21.154
One spark and
it'll set the whole place on fire!

00:05:23.198 --> 00:05:24.825
-Mika!
-We've got no choice.

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:26.326
We'll end this here!

00:05:26.618 --> 00:05:28.745
-Vadakin, your men circle around!
-Okay!

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.914
-Let's go!
-Yes, sir!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.713
-Follow Mika!
-Yeah!

00:05:38.839 --> 00:05:39.673
Fire!

00:05:49.432 --> 00:05:50.976
It's not working!

00:05:51.935 --> 00:05:54.563
Where's that aerial support?!

00:05:59.943 --> 00:06:03.238
It could be that they can't fire
into this position!

00:06:03.321 --> 00:06:04.698
Seems like the case.

00:06:04.781 --> 00:06:06.783
We didn't consider the urban terrain.

00:06:07.409 --> 00:06:09.911
Damn it, stupid Gibbs and his shitty plan!

00:06:11.162 --> 00:06:12.539
Not many bomb lances left.

00:06:12.622 --> 00:06:13.665
Damn it.

00:06:14.124 --> 00:06:16.126
What about stun lances, Takita?

00:06:16.293 --> 00:06:17.127
Okay!

00:06:19.296 --> 00:06:20.130
Vannie!

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:22.674
Please work.

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:36.021
There's no effect.

00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:38.690
It's not wounding as much as it should
with each shot.

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:40.984
The shot isn't penetrating deep enough.

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:42.277
Well, great...

00:06:42.569 --> 00:06:44.946
-These shots aren't cheap either.
-Hey!

00:06:49.743 --> 00:06:51.161
Holy shit! Run!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.833
If guns don't work...

00:06:58.126 --> 00:06:59.544
then I'll go with this.

00:07:01.046 --> 00:07:02.005
Mika!

00:07:03.131 --> 00:07:05.133
He's going to use a spear?

00:07:05.216 --> 00:07:06.384
Mika went that way!

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.804
We can't back down here.

00:07:12.349 --> 00:07:13.725
Niko, cover me!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.809
Not you, too!

00:07:18.897 --> 00:07:21.942
He's starting to take after Mika.

00:07:59.229 --> 00:08:00.313
-Mika!
-Mika!

00:08:00.772 --> 00:08:02.065
Son of a bitch!

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:05.610
Mika!

00:08:07.904 --> 00:08:08.738
Are you okay?

00:08:09.114 --> 00:08:10.115
You're bleeding badly.

00:08:11.491 --> 00:08:12.325
Takita,

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:15.286
bring me a spear.

00:08:15.495 --> 00:08:17.372
You're in no shape to fight!

00:08:17.622 --> 00:08:18.790
You'll die!

00:08:19.624 --> 00:08:23.920
We stabbed this dragon with our spears.

00:08:25.463 --> 00:08:27.424
That means it's our prey.

00:08:29.217 --> 00:08:30.510
We're going to bag it,

00:08:31.302 --> 00:08:32.595
and eat it.

00:08:34.723 --> 00:08:36.975
Hunt, kill,

00:08:37.809 --> 00:08:38.643
and eat.

00:08:39.477 --> 00:08:41.021
That's what a draker does.

00:08:43.815 --> 00:08:45.817
But that's being too reckless!

00:08:47.569 --> 00:08:48.403
Oh, no!

00:08:52.866 --> 00:08:54.617
It's planning on using its heat ray again.

00:08:58.621 --> 00:09:01.207
-What is that?
-That looks bad!

00:09:04.169 --> 00:09:06.046
-Holy shit.
-Are you kidding me?

00:09:06.588 --> 00:09:07.714
Everyone, run!

00:09:07.797 --> 00:09:09.799
Stay out of the ray's path!

00:09:10.133 --> 00:09:12.510
-What are you talking about?
-Just run!

00:09:20.351 --> 00:09:21.561
We failed.

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:33.490
Giraud?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.451
What is he doing?!

00:09:44.709 --> 00:09:46.878
Look, it's Giraud!

00:09:46.961 --> 00:09:48.421
He's climbing the dragon!

00:09:53.635 --> 00:09:54.469
Giraud!

00:10:04.479 --> 00:10:06.606
There's no time!

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.067
What are you doing?

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:11.861
-You have to run!
-Hey, Giraud!

00:10:47.689 --> 00:10:50.275
I can't back down now!

00:11:10.128 --> 00:11:12.172
The weak point is on the median line.

00:11:12.881 --> 00:11:14.132
It should work at this distance!

00:11:48.833 --> 00:11:51.002
I'm not giving up yet!

00:11:58.176 --> 00:12:00.136
Giraud!

00:12:14.192 --> 00:12:15.026
Are you for real?

00:12:17.695 --> 00:12:18.863
The Quin Zaza!

00:12:18.988 --> 00:12:20.490
He did it.

00:12:22.909 --> 00:12:25.787
Hey! Fly more carefully!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.163
Are you trying to wreck us?

00:12:27.664 --> 00:12:31.334
You're the one who said
to charge in without fear!

00:12:31.417 --> 00:12:32.460
I said charge in!

00:12:32.835 --> 00:12:34.587
I didn't say you could break the ship!

00:12:34.837 --> 00:12:36.798
That's impossible!

00:12:38.424 --> 00:12:39.592
We're going to get torn apart!

00:12:40.051 --> 00:12:41.261
Full reverse!

00:12:41.427 --> 00:12:43.846
Reversing spin! We're going to fall.

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:45.306
I'm increasing output!

00:13:10.331 --> 00:13:13.626
I got you!

00:13:13.918 --> 00:13:14.877
Niko!

00:13:16.045 --> 00:13:17.839
You all right?

00:13:19.465 --> 00:13:20.675
Yes!

00:13:22.635 --> 00:13:24.429
That crazy kid.

00:13:24.929 --> 00:13:28.516
What will Lee say
when he sees what we did with the ship?

00:13:32.687 --> 00:13:34.480
Giraud, good job!

00:13:35.106 --> 00:13:37.066
Way to distract it!

00:13:39.902 --> 00:13:40.987
Let's go!

00:13:49.078 --> 00:13:50.872
-Is it over?
-You killed it?

00:13:51.039 --> 00:13:53.374
The city is ruined!

00:13:54.709 --> 00:13:56.252
My tavern!

00:13:56.419 --> 00:13:58.921
Damn it, why did this happen?

00:14:01.591 --> 00:14:02.675
In the end,

00:14:03.051 --> 00:14:06.637
it finally succumbed after we stuck it
with every spear we had.

00:14:08.181 --> 00:14:10.850
That was some tough draking.

00:14:12.602 --> 00:14:13.978
So much blood.

00:14:14.896 --> 00:14:16.731
Doesn't it hurt?

00:14:16.814 --> 00:14:18.191
It hurts.

00:14:19.734 --> 00:14:21.069
Because I'm alive.

00:14:28.117 --> 00:14:30.620
The poor ship...

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.039
What do they think this is?

00:14:34.082 --> 00:14:36.417
Blades are fine. Keep flying.

00:14:38.294 --> 00:14:40.755
Thank goodness.

00:14:41.714 --> 00:14:45.593
The hell it's fine! We'll need to inspect
the ship once we get to port.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.144
Giraud!

00:14:56.813 --> 00:14:57.730
Katja!

00:14:58.231 --> 00:14:59.482
Thank goodness you're okay!

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:01.734
Yeah!

00:15:01.859 --> 00:15:04.278
I was so worried
since your tavern was destroyed.

00:15:04.362 --> 00:15:05.822
We all evacuated in time.

00:15:11.994 --> 00:15:13.704
Thank goodness.

00:15:14.372 --> 00:15:15.498
It's not that big a deal.

00:15:15.832 --> 00:15:17.708
I was so worried.

00:15:18.626 --> 00:15:21.421
Really? You were worried?

00:15:23.005 --> 00:15:24.340
Worried about everyone!

00:15:25.007 --> 00:15:28.302
What the hell? When did this happen?

00:15:28.386 --> 00:15:29.762
He's got balls.

00:15:30.221 --> 00:15:31.764
I gotta respect him.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.808
She's so pretty!

00:15:39.272 --> 00:15:43.609
May I offer a grateful kiss
for our reunion?

00:15:45.111 --> 00:15:45.945
What?

00:15:47.155 --> 00:15:47.989
That's not your job!

00:15:53.119 --> 00:15:54.495
It won't move again?

00:15:55.288 --> 00:15:56.164
Yeah.

00:15:56.539 --> 00:15:58.166
You guys killed it.

00:15:58.291 --> 00:15:59.125
Yeah.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:00.751
I suppose so.

00:16:01.377 --> 00:16:04.839
You know,
it's pretty scary to see one up close.

00:16:05.214 --> 00:16:07.091
Is it going to get butchered now?

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:11.804
Yeah, but it's taken
a lot of poison and stun lances.

00:16:12.972 --> 00:16:14.390
I'm not sure butchering will...

00:16:14.724 --> 00:16:16.851
You won't be able to sell it?

00:16:17.226 --> 00:16:18.060
No.

00:16:18.519 --> 00:16:20.313
It just really lowers the value.

00:16:21.022 --> 00:16:21.981
I know,

00:16:22.523 --> 00:16:24.108
that it's our own doing.

00:16:26.277 --> 00:16:28.070
Value...

00:16:30.448 --> 00:16:31.282
What's going on?

00:16:31.365 --> 00:16:32.783
Is it a fight?

00:16:33.284 --> 00:16:35.328
What are you going to do about it?

00:16:35.411 --> 00:16:38.331
We suffered huge losses
because you drakers screwed up!

00:16:38.414 --> 00:16:40.666
The reason you're able to fly around

00:16:40.791 --> 00:16:43.628
is because this city pays
a good price for your dragons!

00:16:44.045 --> 00:16:45.963
Is this how you treat your benefactors?

00:16:46.297 --> 00:16:49.217
And if we don't get those dragons,

00:16:49.592 --> 00:16:51.177
you're the ones who can't make a living!

00:16:51.385 --> 00:16:53.596
We're the ones
putting our lives on the line!

00:16:53.679 --> 00:16:55.806
I can't believe this attitude!

00:16:55.932 --> 00:16:58.059
-You son of a--
-Cut it out.

00:16:58.309 --> 00:16:59.769
Now's not the time to fight.

00:17:00.603 --> 00:17:02.688
Are you one of them?

00:17:02.772 --> 00:17:04.815
No, not exactly.

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.109
I might be a draker as well.

00:17:07.235 --> 00:17:08.653
What the hell do you want?

00:17:08.736 --> 00:17:11.656
Are you saying that dragon
belongs to your tiny ship?

00:17:11.739 --> 00:17:13.282
I didn't mean it like that.

00:17:13.366 --> 00:17:14.367
This is not good.

00:17:15.826 --> 00:17:18.788
Quon is a crucial port of call
for draking ships.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.748
We don't want to leave with grudges.

00:17:20.873 --> 00:17:22.542
No, that's not what I meant.

00:17:22.875 --> 00:17:25.253
At this rate, we won't be able to find
a buyer for the dragon.

00:17:25.503 --> 00:17:26.546
You sons of bitches!

00:17:28.589 --> 00:17:29.423
Boss!

00:17:30.049 --> 00:17:32.093
The hell are you troubling
the civilians for?

00:17:32.552 --> 00:17:33.511
Should you be moving?

00:17:33.594 --> 00:17:38.599
If you really cared,
then stop making trouble!

00:17:39.016 --> 00:17:43.104
If you got the energy to fight,
then go help clear the rubble!

00:17:43.437 --> 00:17:46.607
-But--
-Shut your trap and get to it!

00:17:49.402 --> 00:17:53.531
I suppose we're all troubled
by idiot subordinates.

00:17:53.656 --> 00:17:55.783
Yeah, idiots will be idiots.

00:17:56.659 --> 00:17:58.953
-You're one of them.
-What's that supposed to mean?

00:17:59.078 --> 00:18:00.204
I mean you're an idiot.

00:18:01.497 --> 00:18:04.875
If it weren't for them,
you guys might have been dead.

00:18:05.793 --> 00:18:07.420
If that blew up,

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.755
things would've been catastrophic.

00:18:14.176 --> 00:18:17.805
But these losses are just...

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:20.558
Gibbs,

00:18:21.183 --> 00:18:23.269
let's donate the dragon to the city.

00:18:24.103 --> 00:18:26.939
-What?!
-What are you talking about, Lee?

00:18:27.189 --> 00:18:31.360
With the extent of these damages,
if we attempt to profit from it,

00:18:31.736 --> 00:18:34.363
we'll strain public opinion
and invite backlash.

00:18:35.239 --> 00:18:36.699
By donating the dragon,

00:18:37.158 --> 00:18:39.910
we should be able to at least
recoup our expenses.

00:18:40.244 --> 00:18:41.162
No way!

00:18:41.454 --> 00:18:43.664
Do you know what we went through?!

00:18:43.748 --> 00:18:46.667
We won't see any money
if we can't sell it.

00:18:51.631 --> 00:18:53.507
What's Crocco gonna say?

00:18:53.591 --> 00:18:54.800
It's fine.

00:18:55.426 --> 00:18:56.302
Crocco?

00:18:57.595 --> 00:18:58.763
As long as the ship's fixed.

00:18:59.889 --> 00:19:00.765
It's decided, then.

00:19:01.599 --> 00:19:02.433
Well,

00:19:03.017 --> 00:19:04.185
we got no other choice.

00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:07.396
All that work for nothing.

00:19:07.688 --> 00:19:09.523
It's called sharing the burden.

00:19:10.024 --> 00:19:12.818
I still get to eat some, right?

00:19:14.195 --> 00:19:16.447
I'm hungry because I'm bleeding.

00:19:16.822 --> 00:19:19.992
I don't think they're related.

00:19:20.618 --> 00:19:23.537
I'll go grab some meat to eat
at Old Man Ula's.

00:19:23.663 --> 00:19:27.291
Come on, Mika.
We're helping with the city's cleanup.

00:19:28.542 --> 00:19:29.460
Let go of me!

00:19:29.835 --> 00:19:32.296
-I'm injured here!
-You've got way too much energy

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.465
-to be considered injured.
-I'm saying let go!

00:19:36.467 --> 00:19:37.718
I thought so.

00:19:38.386 --> 00:19:41.013
Looks like he's fine.

00:19:43.265 --> 00:19:46.352
Honestly, they're all a handful.

00:19:49.897 --> 00:19:51.524
They're your friends.

00:19:52.483 --> 00:19:53.317
Yeah!

00:20:00.116 --> 00:20:01.367
They're good people.

00:20:12.461 --> 00:20:13.504
Hey...

00:20:15.089 --> 00:20:15.923
Katja...

00:20:16.424 --> 00:20:17.258
I'm sorry.

00:20:19.385 --> 00:20:22.221
Looks like the going
to the festival is off the table.

00:20:23.472 --> 00:20:24.849
I know I made you a promise.

00:21:05.639 --> 00:21:06.515
Sorry.

00:21:07.391 --> 00:21:11.061
I mean, your face is so serious!

00:21:18.652 --> 00:21:19.487
But...

00:21:21.197 --> 00:21:22.406
I really wanted to see it.

00:21:24.867 --> 00:21:26.619
When you killed the dragon.

00:22:59.378 --> 00:23:01.881
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
